# Machine-local dev tooling (ZCode workspace config; the .app is a binary
# AppleScript build artifact with hardcoded user paths — the .command is the
# committed source of truth)
.zcodeignore
scripts/chrome-dev-shortcut.app/

# ZCode Desktop app metadata — foreign file, breaks Node module detection ("type": "module")
/package.json

# Local-only backup of the stray ZCode Desktop package.json (see KAN-176)
/package.json.zcode-desktop.bak

# Workspace MCP config contains a Bearer secret — never commit
.zcode/config.json

# Built extension archives — the leak vector in docs/SECURITY_TOKEN_ROTATION.md.
# scripts/zip-extension.py writes gemini-bridge-v<version>.zip here with the
# real token substituted into options.js/background.js/settings.js. A tracked
# zip made both live tokens downloadable from the public repo front page, and
# *.zip above did not cover it because Finder-zipped archives landed at the
# repo ROOT, not here. Ignore the whole directory.
/release/
